    "normalize-path/*": "the suite's own normalize-path.txt says S3 is the exception to path normalization, and S3 is what this store talks to.",
    "post-sts-token/*": "session tokens. This store uses long-lived bucket credentials from the environment.",
    "get-vanilla-query-order-value / get-vanilla-query-order-key": "duplicate query KEYS (the same name twice, differing only in value or its case). Our canonical query is a map, deliberately - an S3 object request never needs the same parameter twice, and a list would be a shape nothing else in this store can produce."
